---
title: The UI Refresh Continues!
---

We've given the site a new look!

1. A black theme replaces the site's previous dark blue theme.
2. The new fonts should render better at lower resolutions and make texts easier to read.

We've also thoroughly rebuilt the character detail pages.

1. Skills are now displayed in a single column. Some details (especially numeric values) are highlighted in the color of the character's Combat Element Type.
2. Trace stat bonuses are now shown as totals by default. Select **View node breakdown** on a card to see how much each node contributes.
3. We've recreated the in-game skill tree. You'll find it in the **Training Calculator** on character detail pages. When you look up your own characters by UID, the tree also shows which Traces you've activated.
